        </div>

        <div class="req-grid">
          <div class="info-card">
            <h3>Wallpapers and themes</h3>
            <p class="card-p">
              kuwai does not ship third-party wallpapers in its repository. Each theme under <code>themes/*/</code> lists wallpaper URLs and checksums in <code>wallpapers.tsv</code> and credits every photographer, artist, and licence in <code>themes/*/CREDITS.txt</code>. Running <code>kuwai-theme install</code> downloads them directly to your machine for personal use and copies <code>CREDITS.txt</code> beside them.
