              <li>Agent and tool marks in <code>shell/assets/brands/</code> remain trademarks of their respective owners; full attributions live in <a href="https://github.com/KitsuneKode/kuwai/blob/main/NOTICE.md" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="inline-link">NOTICE.md</a>.</li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
